      "text": "int sum(int n){\n    if(n==0)\n        return n;\n    else\n        return n + sum(n-1);\n}\nsum(4);",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int sum(int n){\n    if(n==0)\n        return n;\n    else\n        return n + sum(n-1);\n}\nsum(4);",
